1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:04,770
We are in Madrid! And this is our hotel.

2
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,201
It has a spinning door. I like it.

3
00:00:08,047 --> 00:00:10,637
Gus! Please stop spinning!

4
00:00:11,266 --> 00:00:14,096
I... cannot... stop.

5
00:00:19,215 --> 00:00:22,517
Good evening! Welcome to Hotel Pato

6
00:00:22,463 --> 00:00:24,677
Real. How can I help you?

7
00:00:25,269 --> 00:00:27,102
Hello! I have a reservation.

8
00:00:27,435 --> 00:00:30,158
A reservation means you booked a room before.

9
00:00:33,837 --> 00:00:36,387
Of course. What is your name, please?

10
00:00:37,158 --> 00:00:39,575
Sofia. And my friend is Gus.

11
00:00:40,029 --> 00:00:45,199
...Yes. A room for two nights. And... one goose?

12
00:00:45,636 --> 00:00:46,778
That is me.

13
00:00:48,154 --> 00:00:52,956
The booking says: Gus Goose, plus twenty burgers.

14
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:56,490
He... travels with his food.

15
00:00:56,859 --> 00:00:59,289
No problem! Welcome to Madrid.

16
00:00:59,701 --> 00:01:01,475
Can I have a key card, please?

17
00:01:01,738 --> 00:01:03,978
A key card opens the door of your room.

18
00:01:04,359 --> 00:01:08,552
Here you are. Two key cards. Room four-oh-four.

19
00:01:11,464 --> 00:01:14,104
Gus! Did you eat the key card?!

20
00:01:14,386 --> 00:01:16,669
It was crunchy.

21
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:19,400
...Here is another one.

22
00:01:19,976 --> 00:01:21,609
What time is breakfast?

23
00:01:22,175 --> 00:01:24,033
Breakfast is the first meal of the day.

24
00:01:24,695 --> 00:01:27,329
Breakfast is from seven to ten, in the restaurant.

25
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:29,943
Seven... in the morning?

26
00:01:30,704 --> 00:01:32,494
Yes. Seven in the morning.

27
00:01:32,795 --> 00:01:35,385
I will be there at six.

28
00:01:36,375 --> 00:01:38,651
Follow me, please! The lift is here.

29
00:01:39,904 --> 00:01:42,704
A lift? Is it a flying machine?

30
00:01:43,443 --> 00:01:45,593
No, Gus. A lift is

31
00:01:45,496 --> 00:01:48,553
an elevator. It goes up.

32
00:01:53,053 --> 00:01:55,155
What a beautiful room!

33
00:01:55,309 --> 00:01:57,790
It is very hot in here.

34
00:01:58,257 --> 00:02:01,479
Oh no. The air conditioning doesn't work.

35
00:02:01,795 --> 00:02:03,495
Air conditioning is the machine

36
00:02:03,409 --> 00:02:05,335
that makes the room cool.

37
00:02:09,118 --> 00:02:11,148
I can fix it.

38
00:02:15,323 --> 00:02:17,803
Gus is not an air conditioner!

39
00:02:18,399 --> 00:02:22,616
Sorry, sorry! One minute... Done! Now it is cool.

40
00:02:23,001 --> 00:02:25,035
Thank you! What's the Wi-Fi password?

41
00:02:25,291 --> 00:02:27,531
A password is a secret word.

42
00:02:27,501 --> 00:02:29,851
You need it for the internet.

43
00:02:30,173 --> 00:02:33,390
It is: burgers, one, two, three.

44
00:02:33,694 --> 00:02:35,230
That is my password too.

45
00:02:38,830 --> 00:02:43,460
Gus... it is six o'clock. Breakfast is at seven.

46
00:02:43,692 --> 00:02:46,418
I know. I am early.

47
00:02:53,652 --> 00:02:55,987
Gus! You ate the whole buffet!

48
00:02:56,642 --> 00:03:00,156
Sir... that was breakfast for fifty guests.

49
00:03:00,363 --> 00:03:01,846
It was a good breakfast.

50
00:03:03,149 --> 00:03:05,575
Excuse me. What time is check-out?

51
00:03:05,943 --> 00:03:07,183
Check-out is when you leave the

52
00:03:07,113 --> 00:03:08,863
hotel and give back the key.

53
00:03:09,952 --> 00:03:12,152
Check-out is at eleven o'clock.

54
00:03:12,692 --> 00:03:14,145
Eleven? Today?

55
00:03:14,698 --> 00:03:16,548
Yes, Gus. Today.

56
00:03:16,799 --> 00:03:18,802
Then I will live in the lobby.

57
00:03:19,542 --> 00:03:22,044
Or you can pay the bill, sir.

58
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,650
...I will check out.

59
00:03:24,467 --> 00:03:26,477
Let's practice! Say it with me!

60
00:03:26,764 --> 00:03:28,114
I have a reservation.

61
00:03:30,292 --> 00:03:31,882
Can I have a key card, please?

62
00:03:34,081 --> 00:03:35,351
What time is breakfast?

63
00:03:37,530 --> 00:03:39,920
The air conditioning doesn't work.

64
00:03:42,103 --> 00:03:43,773
What's the Wi-Fi password?

65
00:03:45,970 --> 00:03:47,400
What time is check-out?

66
00:03:50,109 --> 00:03:53,086
Quick quiz! What did Gus eat for breakfast?

67
00:03:53,180 --> 00:03:57,730
A: One toast. Or B: The whole buffet.

68
00:04:01,661 --> 00:04:03,931
B! The whole buffet!

69
00:04:05,325 --> 00:04:08,635
Where do YOU want to stay? A hotel, a

70
00:04:08,565 --> 00:04:12,475
hostel, or a tent? Write it in the comments!

71
00:04:12,909 --> 00:04:15,071
See you next time! Bye!

72
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:18,106
Bye bye. I am not checking out.

